@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557
skinparam activityStartColor #163E52
skinparam activityEndColor #163E52
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M06 — Capture actual submitted materials
start
:CF-M06-S01\nInitiating actor\nApplicant identifies actual\nsubmitted resume/letter material\nfor the intended application.;
if (CF-M06-S02\nCurrent application authority and\nactual event/material context\nvalid?) then (yes)
:CF-M06-S03\nApplicant\nIdentify what was actually sent,\nincluding external/uploaded\nvariants;
:CF-M06-S04\nSystem\nAssess provenance and required\nresume/letter/material components;
if (CF-M06-S05\nActual intended components\navailable?) then (yes)
:CF-M06-S06\nSystem\nCapture identifiable actual\nmaterial independently of current\nlive source;
if (CF-M06-S07\nAll required actual components\nconfirmed preserved?) then (yes)
:CF-M06-S08\nSystem\nReport complete actual set; later\nprofile/publication edits leave it\nunchanged;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M06-S09\nSystem\nReport incomplete/failed/unknown\ncapture truthfully; preserve\ndistinguishable evidence;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M06-S10\nSystem\nRecord missing material; no\ncurrent-live substitution or\ncomplete-preservation claim;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M06-S11\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
